{"items":[{"id":"472285653","root":"472281195","user":{"id":"900725","name":"⎛⎝wechen⎠⎞","avatar":"240c4647c921880120985ca8"},"text":"我知道虚拟偶像虚拟主播这些总有一天要说再见，但是我想象不到那一天，更想象不到这一天会这么快。\n我手里握着一百个牌子，但是除了特殊时候进直播间会换，我一直都是人传人。手头不算宽裕，也很惭愧没能支持苇宝什么，但是人传人是我手里牌子等级最高的几个之一。\n但是，任何时候都一样。任何时候，离别都会比预期来得早。即便如此，大家还是会说，再见，总有一天会再见的。再见，我们会在别处相见的。所以我，虽然离你很远很远，但还是想说，再见，总有一天我们会在别处相见的。[emot=acfun,1684/]","time":1627834892156,"floor":1,"likes":9,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472287417","root":"472281195","user":{"id":"14121903","name":"夢咚咚","avatar":"f72e2aff343ec2421948aa8f"},"text":"有一次我听到阿苇在讲“一期一会”，就觉得阿苇涉猎的真的好广，后面还有教你怎么做饭怎么过日子[emot=acfun,1672/]我……","time":1627835082066,"floor":1,"likes":8,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472317018","root":"472281195","user":{"id":"209222","name":"逝魂","avatar":"3062a26a67be1ff8d76d5e28"},"text":"同样人传人是我的第一个牌子，也是等级最高的一个牌子","time":1627837953818,"floor":1,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"⎛⎝wechen⎠⎞","replyToUserId":"900725","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472488172","root":"472281195","user":{"id":"28245228","name":"瑟心","avatar":"e35269a298449ed181bd9f79"},"text":"啾被雪藏，苇要走[emot=acfun,1653/]当时多有爱的姐妹情啊","time":1627857267228,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"240c4647c921880120985ca8":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2021_04_20/1618859649383.JPG?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/mfKg9o9tYm-bMnMRb-7ZRb2a-MFriAv-2Ezqyi.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2021_04_20/1618859649383.JPG"]},"3062a26a67be1ff8d76d5e28":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/Qz2LdQgrJsUVH7rwAtWmBYBOs39lVJhr.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/Cdg8haJu6i-RNryUj-eUjUni-2MzQBz-vABR